# Mac 和 PC 協作：倉庫和工作目錄的文字檔一律用 LF，避免整檔「全部改過」的假差異。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Unity 文字資源（YAML）
*.unity    text eol=lf
*.prefab   text eol=lf
*.asset    text eol=lf
*.meta     text eol=lf
*.mat      text eol=lf
*.anim     text eol=lf
*.controller text eol=lf
*.overrideController text eol=lf
*.physicMaterial text eol=lf
*.playable text eol=lf
*.mask     text eol=lf
*.spriteatlas text eol=lf

# 程式與設定
*.cs       text eol=lf diff=csharp
*.shader   text eol=lf
*.cginc    text eol=lf
*.hlsl     text eol=lf
*.uss      text eol=lf
*.uxml     text eol=lf
*.json     text eol=lf
*.asmdef   text eol=lf
*.asmref   text eol=lf
*.swift    text eol=lf
*.m        text eol=lf
*.mm       text eol=lf
*.h        text eol=lf
*.md       text eol=lf
*.sh       text eol=lf

# Windows 專用腳本保留 CRLF
*.bat      text eol=crlf
*.cmd      text eol=crlf
*.ps1      text eol=crlf

# 二進位檔
